 "description": "Screen a Brazilian CNPJ, all branches of the same company (CNPJ root) and its corporate partners against the official CGU sanction lists: CEIS (debarred), CNEP (anti-corruption penalties), CEPIM (barred non-profits), leniency agreements, plus the Ministry of Labour forced-labour employer list. Each hit has type, body, dates, active flag and an evidence URL. Beyond a plain CEIS/CNEP check. Signed answer (Ed25519 attestation), verifiable at /v1/verify.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
